WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.660
Many Hindus believe the self is
born, dies and is born again,

2
00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.500
life after life.

3
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.900
Even heaven, they say, is
only a stop along the way:

4
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.400
when good karma is used
up, rebirth follows.

5
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.500
But Hindus also believe the cycle can end.

6
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.090
They call that release moksha.

7
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.520
So what is it like?

8
00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:23.580
When rebirth ends, do you
merge into the divine,

9
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.780
or stay yourself for ever?

10
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:30.180
In this mission, you'll find out what
Hindu teachers say moksha is like.

11
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.030
Then you'll explore the
paths said to lead there:

12
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.880
knowledge, action and devotion.

13
00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:41.170
Your mission: find out what Hindus believe
happens to the self when rebirth ends.
